      "type": "text",
      "value": "Design an interior panel of a flat slab having drop panel and column capital. The columns are 22ft on centre on both directions, and capital is 3ftX3ft at the bottom of the drop panel. The slab carries a uniform live load of 50psf and extra dead load of 50psf for interior partition wall along with 0.5kip/ft load on grid line for permanent partition wall, 20psf floor finish in addition to its self-weight. Assume fc'=3000psi; fy=72.5ksi"
